What is implemented in your code:

Responsive shell with four tabs, mobile menu, sticky header.
Builder with five template functions that interpolate the form data, plus quick presets.
Simulated streaming (12 characters every 25 ms) into a contenteditable canvas, with a live word and character count.
Vault backed by localStorage, seeded with two sample documents, with save, search, open, analyze, delete, and clear.
Analyzer with keyword rules (severability, limitation of liability, termination, "indefinitely" and "zero liability") that produces a findings list and risk badge.
Export to clipboard, .txt, and print; toast notification system.

